# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated but tracked, on purpose
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Two directories hold generated files that are committed anyway, because ignoring them would
# break a fresh clone:
#
#   tests/OfficeNet.Docs.Tests/Notebooks/  — lifted from notebooks/*.ipynb by
#       tools/gen_notebook_tests.py. Tracked so `dotnet test` works without Python installed;
#       CI regenerates and fails if the result differs, so they cannot go stale.
#
#   docs/screenshots/ — produced by tools/ScreenshotGen. Tracked because the documentation embeds
#       them and someone reading the repository on the web needs them present.

